content/reports/tbr-quality.jsonl
content/reports/tbr-stage-timings.jsonl
content/reports/tbr-audit-latest.json
# G23-C cron logs (live-qa / calibration, one file per ISO week; pruned after 8 weeks by crontab.production)
content/reports/logs/*
!content/reports/logs/.gitkeep
# O1 / L1-10 (2026-10-20): runtime outputs that crons / deploys / the app
# rewrite every day. The repo is PUBLIC — security-posture*.json(l) lists
# unguarded routes. Readers use the LIVE web dir (lib/runtime-paths, absolute
# live paths), so the files stay on disk; they just leave git. Untracked from
# the index with scripts/untrack-runtime-reports.sh (index only — never run a
# plain `git rm` / merge that deletes them from the live checkout).
# KEPT committed (inputs / curated): schema-migrations.json, version.json,
# project-state.json + implementing-plan.md + architecture.md (CEO ledger the
# orchestrator git-adds), ceo-current-plan.json, clevel-kpi-matrix.json,
# kb-equity-methodologies.json, svi-exchange-tasks.json, validation-tracker.json,
# claims-backfill.json, self-fix-playbook.json, _daily-report-template.md,
# svi-backtest-latest.json (published figures; the deck appendix test quotes its caveats) and
# the hand-written audit / review .md files.
content/reports/ai-free-models.json
content/reports/ai-free-models-verified.json
content/reports/ai-free-models-verify-history.jsonl
content/reports/ai-model-strikes.json
content/reports/ai-spend-daily.json
content/reports/backup-health.jsonl
